Opty to Order Assessment - Pain Points & Big Rocks
Pain Points/Challenges
EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
Total Issues by Proces, System or Data
Salesforce Accounts & Opportunities
Lack of support for multiple-product lines per opportunity in salesforce restricts detailed product-level forecasting capabilities for sales teams
The absence of a synchronized master data system between Salesforce and Zuora leads to inconsistencies and forces account executives to manually search for contact information, affecting efficiency and accuracy
Products, Pricing & Packaging
SKU Proliferation (over 3.5K sku’s per currency), lack of sales guidance and lack of configuration experience has led to sales teams depending more on the deals desk for assistance
Quoting, Contract, Renewal
Manual Approval process  - more than 50% of the quotes goes to manual approval process resulting in higher deal cycle time
Manual Renewal process - duplicate opportunities for Renewal resulting in manual edits with lack of standardization and automation
Order-Billing & Rev
The absence of a Contract Lifecycle Management (CLM) system leads to significant productivity challenges due to the manual creation and updating of proposal and order form documents
The absence of a two-way synchronization between quoting and billing necessitates manual processes for subscription renewals
