Opty to Order Assessment : Process Impacts
To Be Process
Opportunity Management
(Sales)
Quote Management
(Sales & Deals Desk)
Renewal Quotes 
(Renewal Specialist)
Order Management
(Billing Ops)
A. Pipeline Management & Forecasting  
New process for Pipeline Management as Opportunities will be tracked and managed for multiple products 
Manage Opportunity Products and Systematic Sync with Quote for accurate Forecasting 
Eliminate redundant data entry by avoiding Opportunity creation & Tracking for single/Individual products 
Forecast by tracking opportunities for multiple products giving better visibility and insights on Customer purchases 
B. Opportunity Management & Tracking 
Simplify Sales Opportunities with GTM flows & categories, like 
i) New Business 
ii) Amend (Upsell, Cross-Sell, Downsell)
iii) Renewal
iv) Services
Optimize Opportunity Management by eliminating and reducing number of attributes captured during opportunity creation; ensure opportunity process is integrated (bi-directional) with Quote, Order and Renewals.
A. Quotation, Approvals, Templates & Proposals
Unify Subscription and Service quoting with CPQ (the process is currently distributed with multiple systems)
Improve ‘Ease of Doing’ business with Zuora and simple Sales Quoting by enabling Guided Selling and Attribute Based Pricing
Empower Sales for quotes with Standard discounting and Terms & Conditions 
Deals Desk Reviews only Complex Non Std Deals 
Simplify /  Streamline and Optimize Non Std Approval criteria and thresholds 
Process change for Non Std Terms and Conditions quotes by leveraging Contract Life Cycle Management 

B. Quote to Order 
Streamline Quote to Order process by capturing mandatory attributes upfront on Quote to reduce Order Manual validations (Billing Accounts and Contacts / Payment Terms etc)
A. Renewal Opportunity & Quote 
Increase Renewal efficiency by automating Renewal Opportunity and Quote creation, with business rules driven by customer preference, expiring subscriptions, evergreen subscriptions etc
Enable Business Process to Identify Proactive (Systematic) Quotes 
Improve visibility into Customer Purchases, Add ons and accurate ARR spend tracking by providing Customer Purchase History through seamless integration with Order Management
Enable amendment flow for Quantity Expansion and Upgrades 
Standardize Quote to Order process for New Business & Renewals 
A. Order Validations and Processing  
Reduce Order touch rate by enabling rules to validate Quotes before submission
Automate the order validation processes with orchestration to eliminate manual touch, improve auto book orders and order cycle time

