SaaS Standard Epics / User Stories
User Stories
Function
Persona
Story Name
Story Summary
Details
Product Administration
Product Admin/ CPQ Admin
Create & Manage Products
Ability to manage the lifecycle and all the attributes of the product as part of the Product Administration so that the sales reps/end users can find and Quote the Products as part of the Quotation Process
View & Search for the Products
Creation of New Products
Add/Update the Product Attributes (like Name, Description, Code, Family, Category, Images etc..) on the Product record.
Define custom product attributes
Add/Update the start and end dates of the Product record
Mark the product as Active/Inactive
Product Administration
Product Admin/ CPQ Admin
Create & Manage Product Bundles
Ability to create & manage the bundles and bundle structure as part of Product Administration so that the sales reps/end users can easily configure the solution to meet the customer needs as part of the Quotation Process
View & Search for the Bundle Products
Creation of New Bundle Product
Define the Bundle Product Attributes that would impact the Bundle (Bundle Type , Configuration Experience..)
Add/Remove the Options Products to the Bundle. Options can be other Products including bundles
Setup the Groupings,Group level Attributes ( Group Type ) , Sequence for the options to display the Options products in Configuration Process
Sharing of the Option Groupings across multiple Bundles
Setting up of default options/mandatory Options/default quantities of the options with in a bundle
Mark the bundle as Active/Inactive or specify the start and end dates for availability.
