Manual Approval process  - more than 50% of the quotes goes to manual approval process
Lack of CLM resulting in manual generation of Proposal / Order Form Document
Lack of bi-directional sync between Quote and Billing resulting in missing information for Subscription renewals
Manual Renewal process - duplicate opportunities for Renewal resulting in manual edits with lack of standardization and automation
