Information Architecture
91

Checklist
Do we have the Product Admin identified?

Product List   - Do we have the list of active Products & Product Families  identified along with the content(images, documents etc) needed?

Product Models - Did we identify the details of the Product Models and the configuration experience that need to be supported ?

Category Hierarchy - Do we have the catalog navigation experience defined?

Future Product Models - Do we have the details of the Products/Product models to be made available in CPQ  over the next 6 months to 1 year?

Product Rules - Did we identify the rules (visibility, constraint etc..) that need to be enabled in the system.


Do we have the processes enabled for handling EOL/EOS products?

Do we know the frequency and types of changes to be done on products on an ongoing basis?

Do we have the pain points in current Product management identified?

Do we have the source of truth for the Products identified and considered if any transformations are needed for integration?

Did we consider the all the downstream impacts in Product Modeling ( Fulfillment, Billing etc..)


