Quoting Process- Guidelines
Standardize the Quoting Process to support New, Add-On, Change, Renewals.
Capture the Price impacting information on the quote header before the Pricing step.
Enable visibility of customer assets at account level in salesforce.
Consider & capture the information that needs to be synced to opportunity at different stages of quote life cycle (Eg: Opportunity Products for forecasting, NS Terms on Opportunity, setting the Opportunity stage/ status based on quote status)
Rationalize and Generate Proposals to present the quote all the required terms and conditions
Capture the deal/agreement cycle time to measure and optimize the process.
Enable Auto Renewals for streamlining the renewal process.
Enable Self Service for renewals ,changes, Invoices if applicable to streamline the process.

