Order Management GuideLines
Ensure the checks & processes required for order booking are enabled as part of  order capture process.
Streamline information from the ordering process to allow applicable fulfillment details to flow downstream
Ensure customers are not billed or invoiced until an order is fulfilled by establishing standardized workflow
Auto-create and track orders on the CRM platform to improve operational visibility and reporting
Ensure the capture of appropriate errors and re-processing mechanism for the orders.
Enable any transformations required for the integration with downstream systems at the time of Order Capture.

