132

Contract GuideLines
Migrate manual offline contract management processes to a centralized platform that accommodates and digitizes key CLM processes and data capture
Consolidate similar contract templates to reduce maintenance efforts and inconsistencies
Use a single, robust, repository to maintain and store all contract templates allowing users to easily store, browse, search, and access content on demand
Standardize and automate legal approvals and leverage auto-approvals to limit approval volume and accelerate the negotiation processes
Fully leverage the capabilities of e Signature tools (DocuSign/Adobe Sign) to initiate and complete the signature process 
Ensure that finalized fully signed contracts are stored and easily accessible by all stakeholders in a centralized location
