Opty to Order Assessment : Process Impacts
To Be Process
Opportunity Management
(Sales )
Quote Management
(Sales & Deals Desk)
Renewal Quotes 
(Renewal Specialist)
Order Management
(Billing Ops)
A. Pipeline Management & Forecasting  
New process for Pipeline Management as Opportunities will be tracked and managed for multiple products 
Manage Opportunity Products and Systematic Sync with Quote for accurate Forecasting 
Eliminate redundant data entry by avoiding Opportunity creation & Tracking for single/Individual products 
Forecast by tracking opportunities for multiple products giving better visibility and insights on Customer purchases 
B. Opportunity Management & Tracking 
Optimize and Reduce Opportunity Types and focus on key categories : 
i) New Business 
ii) Up Sell 
iii) Cross Sell
iv) Renewal
 v) Migration 

Rationalize Opportunity attributes by eliminating and reducing # of attributes captured  and simplifying Opportunity tracking 
Integrate Opportunity management process with Order Management for seamless reconciliation and closure of Upsell and Renewal Opportunity
A. Quotation Management & Approvals
Unified Seamless Quoting Process for Licenses and Services leveraging CPQx 
Enable Guided Selling and Attribute Based Pricing 
Empower Sales for quotes with Standard discounting and Terms & Conditions 
Deals Desk Reviews only Complex Non Std Deals 
Simplify /  Streamline and Optimize Non Std Approval criteria and thresholds 
Process change for Non Std Terms and Conditions quotes by leveraging Contract Life Cycle Management 

B. Quote to Order 
Streamline Quote to Order process by capturing mandatory attributes upfront on Quote to reduce Order Manual validations (Billing Accounts and Contacts / Payment Terms etc)
A. Renewal Opportunity & Quote Management
Business rules to Integrate and Orchestrate Order Management process with CPQx to generate Renewal Quotes by customer preference, expiring subscriptions, evergreen subscriptions etc
Business Process to Identify Proactive (Systematic) Quotes and Reactive (Manual) Quotes 
Customer Purchase History for Accounts through seamless integration with Order Management to get better visibility into Customer Purchases, Add ons and accurate ARR spend tracking 
Amendment flow for UpSell , Cross Sell ,downsell , Qty Expansion and Upgrades 
Standardize Quote to Order process for New Business & Renewals 
A. Order Validations and Processing  
Process change to reduce  Quote to Order Validation 
Revisit all Manual Process for Validation with Gsheet and update based on systematic validations enabled 
Low touch Auto Booking 

